    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "html",
    "title": "Creating Links",
    "descriptionContent": "Use tags and attributes to create all sorts of links and turn webpages into websites.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17111,
        "title": "Links and Attributes",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Let's take a look at how links work to connect a <strong>game menu</strong> to other <strong>game screens</strong>. Click on <code>Start mission!</code> to use the link.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA; &lt;style&gt;&#xA;  body {&#xA;   background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #1f4037, #99f2c8);&#xA;   text-align: center;&#xA;   font-family: &quot;Verdana&quot;, Sans-serif;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  img {&#xA;   margin: 40px;&#xA;   height: 40px;&#xA;   width: 150px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h1 {&#xA;   margin-top: 30px;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  h3 {&#xA;   margin: 20px;&#xA;   font-weight: normal;&#xA;  }&#xA;  &#xA;  p {&#xA;   margin-top: 80px;&#xA;   margin-left: 30px;&#xA;   margin-right: 30px;&#xA;   padding: 20px;&#xA;   background-color: DimGray;&#xA;  }&#xA; &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA; &lt;h1&gt;Ready to play?&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;a&#xA;  href=&quot;https://example.com/level-1&quot;&gt;Start&#xA;  mission!&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To start creating a link, we add the text in between the <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code> tags. This won't highlight the text yet.</p><p><code>&lt;a&gt;</code> stands for \"Anchor\" tag.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Open Inventory\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To link the text to a webpage, we add <code>href=\"\"</code> along with a Uniform Resource Locator (<strong>URL</strong>). <code>href</code> is short for \"hypertext reference\".</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/leaderboard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"View High Scores\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>href</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"https://example.com/leaderboard\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href</code> is an <strong>attribute</strong>. All attributes have two things in common: they provide extra information and they go inside the opening tag.</p><p>Attributes are added after the name of the tag, and before the <code>&gt;</code> closing sign.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/settings&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Settings\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We link to a webpage by adding <code>=</code> after the attribute and a URL as a value in between quotes.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/credits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"View Credits\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code> followed by <code>\"</code> and then <code>https://example.com/credits</code>, <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create an opening <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> tag with the <code>href</code> attribute set to <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/level-select&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Choose Level\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code> followed by <code>a</code> and then <code>href</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://example.com/level-select\"</code>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144756,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do links do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Link game pages to other pages and websites</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Increase player health</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Link game pages to other pages and websites.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144757,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why is the link not working?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Because it has no <code>href</code> attribute</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because it has no text between <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because it has no <code>href</code> attribute.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144758,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when a player clicks the link on this game page?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/store&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Get Power-Ups\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   &amp; Skins\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The link directs the player to another website</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing, because the <code>href</code> attribute is missing</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The link directs the player to another website.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are <code>attributes</code> for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To provide additional information about tags</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To turn all tags into enemies</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To provide additional information about tags.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 144760,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pick the opening tag that makes the link clickable.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;a&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/wiki&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;a href=\"https://example.com/wiki\"&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 144761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the attribute and its value so that clicking the link directs players to the game's community page.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/community&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Join the Community\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>href</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"https://example.com/community\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 144762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Put together the tag to direct players to the patch notes page.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/patch-notes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Read Patch Notes\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;/</code>, followed by <code>a</code>, and finally <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 144763,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Type the <code>href</code> attribute.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/support&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Report a bug\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
